{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "98fe5240993bd620238aafab00d264b15c0a81287503f2f740b652213720bbed", "ja": "『ロックでクールなデュオユニット』に\n選ばれたジュリアと静香。ジュリアは好きな\nロックが歌えると喜び、静香もジュリアと歌\nえる事、歌を認められた事に心が浮き立つ。\n新ユニットは順調な滑り出しを見せる。", "zh": "茱莉亚与静香被选为『摇滚酷帅双人组团体』\n成员，茱莉亚很高兴能演唱喜欢的摇滚歌曲，\n静香也认为能与茱莉亚合唱，\n代表自己的歌声获得肯定，内心雀跃无比。\n新团体就这样顺利地起步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "488d1c008253e7d1409a381b2e446ead3984202b8c83297fadee112453959f4e", "ja": "（ジュリアと静香の新ユニット。\nきっと、これまでにない新しいものになるに違いない）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和静香组成的新团体，\n肯定会带来不同以往的新气象。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "274272236a1e37530d89d9aa850d6c5bd83630e8c0e01c169e98879cf8d7d85c", "ja": "……と、いうわけで、ふたりには\n新曲のためのユニットを組んでもらうことになった。", "zh": "……事情就是这样，\n要请你们两位组成团体来演唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "935f74b65d333586f4ad9bdc765122699fa6df74507f5439c93b54554bb367a1", "ja": "ふたりの歌唱力を存分に発揮するいい機会だと思う。\nやってくれるか？", "zh": "我想这是个能让你们尽情发挥歌唱实力的好机会。\n你们愿意加入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "65d1257dcc7071c9fc0c739212d486caab6d4fe89aa4c96c44a86ed0ec94017e", "ja": "やるに決まってるだろ、{$P$}！", "zh": "那当然啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "c0910c788b360bf3bfba44ce66b9e7160c94f391d81090e63c90287336fa849e", "ja": "あたしにロックを歌わせてくれるっていうんだ。\n断る理由なんかないね！", "zh": "要我唱摇滚歌曲，\n我哪有理由拒绝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1398da25b2110985b9dd50a6a58a0e84da1d6407768b37d6cb9bb945e9a2b868", "ja": "よかった。\nジュリアならそう言ってくれると思ってたよ。", "zh": "太好了。\n茱莉亚，我就知道你会这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "6a365d0e2a91d62bf21a25caeee52863e25fc95b4fddb99b3f213fed138d6c9b", "ja": "やっぱり、ジュリアさんにとって\nロックは特別なものなんですね。", "zh": "看来在茱莉亚心中，\n摇滚果然占有特别地位呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "c6acfb577c5ddc15112cf1652aece5a1f7b3da16ba4d0033055901e4385ef324", "ja": "ああ。もちろん、アイドル活動も\n大事にしてるつもりだけどさ。", "zh": "是啊。\n啊，偶像工作我当然也很重视。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "3261a4a86a79f98ee8705eae97d98f1a02ae477c88d653a15c82831bca5c1d1b", "ja": "ロックはやっぱり、あたしの原点だし、\nホームっていうのかな。うまく言えないけど……。", "zh": "但摇滚终究还是我的原点，\n或者该说是家乡呢？我不太会形容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa7dad5e50111df6df89d96ade53b837ecef63167e3472154a0533a37fb2e8dd", "ja": "とにかく、ロックを歌える場所があるなら、\nひとつでも逃したくないんだ！", "zh": "总之，只要有机会能唱摇滚歌曲，\n我一个都不想错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4e693ec951776ce7d2a4d571ea13feff77c2c15db7c090dc036e4395c023a4b7", "ja": "それで、静香はどうだ？　静香の実力なら、\nジュリアといい歌が作り上げられると思うんだけど。", "zh": "那静香，你呢？以你的实力，\n我想应该能和茱莉亚共同创造出很棒的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ca1baea7bfabf86ea14bdfef1fd3b401fff6b29bfa585ee7cb4e4fdb5f60ad8", "ja": "そんなの、聞くまでもないじゃないですか！　ジュリア\nさんとのデュオだなんて、嬉しいに決まってます！", "zh": "这种事情还需要问吗！？\n能和茱莉亚组成双人组，我当然很乐意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "d0ebf92a0f8dc60b3d702bc1b77df1544785f09e31cc3a9d9452142efd867a45", "ja": "シズ……。ははっ、サンキュ！", "zh": "静……哈哈！谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a781147ba1a7086b860add06980e39057d704d113c9ec0e015b09ae0a9aa247", "ja": "ジュリアさん。私でよかったら、\nぜひ一緒に……！", "zh": "茱莉亚，你不嫌弃的话，\n请务必和我一起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "79535294b96b26af04a4c3e726858125bbdd0ca6e2430ae0cce881c5dadf505f", "ja": "あ！　あの、でも……\n私、ロックに関しての知識はあまり……。", "zh": "啊！可是不好意思……\n我没有什么摇滚乐方面的知识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "82fed66cc74b03b21ba6908c2ebc2d2a67dc3087b8f5e75ec5219ab7d836a8a1", "ja": "あははっ、そんなのいいんだって！\nロックに知識なんか必要ない。", "zh": "哈哈哈！不用在意这个啦！\n玩摇滚才不需要知识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "3d3ead2e32aff779d35c8810c7c08d11011d158dc25701a264a865eb00a22f54", "ja": "実は前から思ってたんだ。\nシズの声はロックにも向いてそうだってね。", "zh": "静，我以前就一直在想，\n其实你的声音应该也很适合摇滚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "68736178bde2e661cea4019170ba3ecbbc73a8ab4aff66db6ba66df02bdfc256", "ja": "ウチらの歌声が合わさって、どこまでいけるか……。\nイメージしただけで、アツくなってくるよ！", "zh": "我们的歌声合在一起，能激出什么火花……\n光是想像我就热血沸腾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "2c70167e5c9c1bea7210ba858b7e92a6c858322048f46f7dd186a26979918956", "ja": "ジュリアさん……。\nあ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "茱莉亚……\n谢、谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "cfadd5fa48363d3e3477b641ba3d32ffc0739911d60be87ab89f5e1ac4bd5773", "ja": "わかりました。ジュリアさんがいいって言ってくれる\nなら、私はもちろん……全力で頑張ります！", "zh": "我明白了，既然茱莉亚也答应了，\n我当然……也会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "8cd5ef15bce3862da92750fc0b1b13a2cb2de1496138d9b245cba40fad92d31d", "ja": "へへっ、そうこなくっちゃ！\n最高のユニットにしてやろうぜ、シズ！", "zh": "嘿嘿！这样才对嘛！\n让我们组成最棒的团体吧，静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ed08cb5a03533abfac0f420bc74762d92d84eaea43dd2156184431a2403c428", "ja": "はい！　よろしくお願いします、ジュリアさん！", "zh": "好的！请多指教，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2b53de4ed0bb4730c22ddc39a29e350a24c874a74386a9c8a16a453a7914bcc2", "ja": "（ふたりとも、やる気充分だな……！\nこのぶんなら、この先も期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（她们俩充满干劲……！\n看样子之后的发展值得期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "1177b6782cc7553f61ff5c9fbbd00ce6879793e9c66a6a975a3417988d040c78", "ja": "そういえば……{$P$}。\n私達のユニット名は、何になるんですか？", "zh": "话说回来……{$P$}，\n请问我们的团体名称是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a53ab70a35f9556b783390dc57bd094444c698677843df7023e2f8401290c7f0", "ja": "えっ。\nユニット名？", "zh": "咦？\n团体名称？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "2a22515f75b9c80a73fe49d4f8f3e7d919035994d742dd54b3c182624daa6973", "ja": "お、そうだな。{$P$}、\nクールでロックなの、あるんだろ？", "zh": "喔，对啊。{$P$}，\n你应该有想出酷帅又摇滚的名字吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "79349864e8c9bade778709e7047919892384ba8e1cc26b9e31d4c423fcef7714", "ja": "そ、それは……。\n実は、まだ思案中なんだ。", "zh": "这、这个嘛……\n其实我还在想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "66b82494dc23abcc5ca10b31f4fff5682abe77d0729ed84d663389c392591354", "ja": "え？　なんだ、まだ名無しか。", "zh": "呃？什么嘛，还没有名字吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "fa7c8c2746fd28880ac56686014fd5f12c8e84ab2cc395eb65228480cbcb7920", "ja": "さんざんクールとかオルタナティブとか言っておいて、\nまだ名前も決めてなかったんですか？", "zh": "你一直说什么酷帅另类，\n结果连团名都还没决定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "30c72a47a4593ebf7c404c9e8daa0ddbf2e82d45e0a1968d89ca88786fc1533f", "ja": "もう。大人なんですから、しっかりしてください。\n期待して損したじゃないですか。", "zh": "真是的，你是个成年人了，请振作一点。\n害我白白期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c48e14f5d5f43bb1ae98052c8f98977ab835975a72ac24c73cdf7746ea14b574", "ja": "だ、大丈夫、必要になる前には決めるから。\nふたりは気にせず、練習を進めておいてくれ。", "zh": "你、你们放心，我会在需要用到名字之前决定好的。\n你们不用在意，先开始练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "8844c13e06f517edd502cab881a321b24f3fd462db71df6c2e9066b2b0a63772", "ja": "もちろんです。私は、自分の仕事は\nちゃんとしますから。ですよね、ジュリアさん。", "zh": "那当然，我会做好自己分内的工作。\n对吧，茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7687201c8c1cc35fa3108b34b7382aec424817c80e9b92961dfc9a2cf290099", "ja": "あはは、そうだな。{$P$}が\n腰を抜かすような歌を歌ってやろうぜ！", "zh": "哈哈哈，对啊。\n我们来唱出会让{$P$}腿软的歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "bfe3373608d702c4fa74405d3a452b0c94a16cc6d0e4959020829d8e4bf427a0", "ja": "（思った以上にいいコンビかもしれないな。よし、俺も\nふたりが腰を抜かすようなユニット名を考えるぞ！）", "zh": "（这对搭档的默契也许超乎预期。\n好，我也要想个会让她们俩腿软的团体名称！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
